<title>USA: ValliCorp in preliminary merger talks.</title>
<headline>ValliCorp in preliminary merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValliCorp Holdings Inc said Monday it was engaged in preliminary talks regarding a possible merger into another bank holding company.</p>
<p>Vallicorp said its board continues to evaluate all options available to it, including remaining independent.</p>
<p>No further details were provided and the company was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
